#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:99
#: 85afb9fa90a8420a92731284736cd951
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。手动模式时，左侧原子 1-based 索引列表，与右侧一一配对。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. In manual mode, one-based indices for the left "
"atoms, paired position by position with the right list."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:101
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:107
#: 760394df20224a1084742a083039279d ec856112a51b4e73a6447490686c552f
msgid "生效条件：`原子对来源`（`pair_source`）选择手动索引时。"
msgstr "Active when `Pair source` (`pair_source`) uses manual indices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:103
#: 69492d81f17348bdb539795a7065f8f5
msgid "右侧原子对索引（pair_right_indices）"
msgstr "pair_right_indices"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:105
#: bc3eace4e39644128a8c24d1a507e182
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。手动模式时，右侧原子 1-based 索引列表，与左侧一一配对。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. In manual mode, one-based indices for the right "
"atoms, paired position by position with the left list."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:109
#: 74c450f225f34329b3dae3cf4515eee2
msgid "原子对来源（pair_source）"
msgstr "Atom-Pair Source (pair_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:111
#: 2ea954478c0b448fb8bff8b77cb83242
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Manual indices'`。手动索引适合可控验证；自动近邻壳层适合批量生成 "
"DMI/交换路径样本，但需要检查元素对和键方向筛选。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Manual indices'`. Manual indices give controlled, "
"auditable pairs. Automatic neighbor shells generate DMI or exchange-path "
"samples in bulk, but their element and bond-direction filters must be "
"checked."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:113
#: 5d25bd03a43a46c0baa6ce2233f874cc
msgid "近邻壳层（pair_shell）"
msgstr "Neighbor Shell (pair_shell)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:115
#: fa40ccfeb58545dfa13ffc329a1a8df9
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。自动模式时取第几近邻壳层。1 为第一近邻，2 为第二近邻。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `1`. Neighbor shell in automatic mode: 1 for first "
"neighbors, 2 for second neighbors."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:117
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:123
#: 0c8ae23c76b249b3a89b8326784b6b97 18b9dace0c1d4922b4c2bb4330597bf2
msgid "生效条件：`原子对来源`（`pair_source`）选择近邻自动搜索时。"
msgstr "Active when `Pair source` (`pair_source`) uses automatic neighbor search."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:119
#: 6e9c9ab198514ebb96b99b2d06d37cb0
msgid "近邻壳层容差（pair_shell_tolerance）"
msgstr "pair_shell_tolerance"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:121
#: d0595d3973cf4ac4b86d883c49929991
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05`。自动分壳层的距离容差，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Distance tolerance in Å used to cluster "
"automatically detected neighbor shells."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:125
#: 2ba1261bef4c45c0972e43f570c20f9e
msgid "原子对元素筛选（pair_element_filter）"
msgstr "pair_element_filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:127
#: 8e9cb6899c85462c82434c46194c1594
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。按元素对限制自动近邻 pair，例如 `Fe-Fe` 或 `Fe-"
"Co`。DMI/交换路径分析时务必匹配目标相互作用元素对。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Element-pair filter for automatic neighbors, such "
"as `Fe-Fe` or `Fe-Co`. Match it to the interaction channel being studied."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:129
#: 51b5d11baa1943dc9dbdfe0d42ba55ca
msgid "生效条件：自动生成原子对后需要按元素筛选时。"
msgstr "Use when automatically generated pairs must be filtered by element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:131
#: ea3ba10ae504419887651e06fa0c50d0
msgid "原子对分组筛选（pair_group_filter）"
msgstr "pair_group_filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:133
#: 82a9af139c304b3a87f93ddbabde44d3
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。按 group 对限制自动近邻 pair，适合层状 AFM、界面或已标记子晶格。没有上游 group 标签时不要使用。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Group-pair filter for automatic neighbors, useful "
"for layered AFM states, interfaces, or labeled sublattices. Do not use it"
" without upstream `group` labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:135
#: fbb6123ed0ae4b27bcf38a31dc9dbab3
msgid "生效条件：自动生成原子对后需要按 group 筛选时。"
msgstr "Use when automatically generated pairs must be filtered by group."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:137
#: d68f489bbd1a4e709c063da4d92a954b
msgid "键筛选方式（bond_filter_mode）"
msgstr "bond_filter_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:139
#: 501818637db84f87aed6a31b1f2849a1
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Any'`。`Any` 保留所有候选键；`Near axis` 选接近某方向的键；`Near plane` "
"选接近某晶面的键，用于区分面内/面外相互作用。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Any'`. `Any` retains all candidate bonds. `Near axis` "
"selects bonds close to a direction; `Near plane` selects bonds close to a"
" plane, enabling in-plane and out-of-plane interaction channels to be "
"separated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:141
#: abc1d618480f4f8a9e795be4c12d6462
msgid "键筛选轴（bond_filter_axis）"
msgstr "bond_filter_axis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:143
#: 57a715fe8b064c57a911f0523ab95ff5
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。研究面内/面外 "
"DMI 时必须和晶体取向一致。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Reference axis or plane normal for bond filtering. It must match the "
"actual crystal orientation in an in-plane/out-of-plane DMI study."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:145
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:151
#: 1836252e89064c17a2166eb09c283835 4e5df0dd790442b98a554464227136cc
msgid "生效条件：`键筛选方式`（`bond_filter_mode`）不是关闭状态时。"
msgstr "Active when `Bond filter mode` (`bond_filter_mode`) is not disabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:147
#: 8532ab758f6f4964a5dfd15c19c0f9da
msgid "键筛选容差（bond_filter_tolerance）"
msgstr "bond_filter_tolerance"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:149
#: 3dbfec594471405194c80460b3c9abc9
msgid "`float`，默认 `20.0`。方向筛选容差——设太小可能找不到 pair，设太大会混入不该比较的交换路径。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `20.0`. Angular tolerance for bond-direction filtering."
" Too small may select no pairs; too large may mix distinct exchange "
"paths."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:153
#: a53d394417744ab0a016fe53d2b69e99
msgid "Group Pair 模式"
msgstr "Group-pair mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:155
#: 2929f0f829454aba82fbab7422b5d1fa
msgid "A 组（group_a）"
msgstr "group_a"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:157
#: 00ebd449cd7046e5b0a81aafb63d8ad5
msgid "`str`，默认 `'A'`。`arrays['group']` 中的标签名。需要输入已有 group 标签。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'A'`. Label in `arrays['group']` for the first group. "
"The input must already contain group labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:159
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:165
#: 3c8b98d093654508a0700c1843368cd1 e205d90ece7c4439802f3cd026a5b329
msgid "生效条件：需要 group pair、手动 group 或 AFM group 模式时。"
msgstr "Used by group-pair, manual-group, or AFM-group modes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:161
#: dc418842447a446a87b9d25311c8b179
msgid "B 组（group_b）"
msgstr "group_b"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:163
#: f52b585600054e5d8634d80df5e115e7
msgid "`str`，默认 `'B'`。`arrays['group']` 中的标签名。需要输入已有 group 标签。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'B'`. Label in `arrays['group']` for the second group. "
"The input must already contain group labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:167
#: 5664c42a60ff417ba6f497b8d3329bb5
msgid "角度和手性"
msgstr "Angles and chirality"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:169
#: f91c1c81dc994e0e857f125319e5b068
msgid "倾斜角列表（angle_list）"
msgstr "angle_list"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:171
#: 073b36012e67497c9de2f43511212777
msgid "`str`，默认 `'1,2,5,10'`。逗号分隔的偏转角列表，单位度。推荐从这个默认列表起步。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'1,2,5,10'`. Comma-separated tilt angles in degrees. The"
" default is a practical small-angle starting set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:173
#: 44310758869f46518f965ca2051a36f4
msgid "倾斜符号（tilt_signs）"
msgstr "tilt_signs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:175
#: 47db824a07254938baac079c09c7be72
msgid "`str`，默认 `'Positive only'`。只做 +θ 可以验证局部响应；同时做 ±θ 才能提取手性不对称项，DMI 数据建议用成对输出。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Positive only'`. A `+θ` sample is enough for a local-"
"response check. Matched `±θ` samples are required to isolate chirality-"
"odd contributions and are recommended for DMI data."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:177
#: ab0f250579ba4c5e927b938871c92000
msgid "包含参考构型（include_reference）"
msgstr "include_reference"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:179
#: 124bbd014ad846089e69d5b81a30e418
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `True`。额外输出一帧未偏转的参考磁态，方便做 energy difference 对比。打开后 "
"`最大输出数`（`max_outputs`）至少为 2，确保预算中还留有一帧真正的 canting 输出。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `True`. Also output one untilted reference magnetic state"
" for energy-difference comparisons. When enabled, set `max_outputs` to at"
" least 2 so the budget still includes one actual canting output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:181
#: dc2fdec0724e47998a4460081d0ae54c
msgid "磁矩与参考态"
msgstr "Moments and reference state"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:183
#: 093c7c02776343cf92a834653afaafaa
msgid "磁矩大小来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "magnitude_source"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:185
#: 6ff23d3c1c9d4c07bdefb4e5de6e66ed
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。已有 `initial_magmoms` "
"时复用它最安全；没有磁矩输入时用 "
"`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）/`默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）构造幅值。不要用默认幅值替代已知元素磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'Existing initial magmoms'`. Reusing existing "
"`initial_magmoms` is safest when available. When the input has no "
"moments, construct magnitudes from `magmom_map` and `default_moment`. Do "
"not replace known element moments with a generic default."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:187
#: 0309e9a3e146408fbef680ab75bc4727
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:189
#: ea4a1a8488d34055b13112d53ef2fcd8
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。已知元素局域磁矩时显式写入，如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。未知元素不要用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. Provide known element-resolved local moments "
"explicitly, for example `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`. Do not invent a prior for an "
"unknown element through a default value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:191
#: 1a4e55027e914eb69e83423f8043a228
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:193
#: 141fe4b5cb984e258ee916e81da1010e
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）未命中元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持"
" 0。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`. Used only as a fallback magnitude for elements "
"absent from `magmom_map`. List important magnetic elements explicitly; "
"nonmagnetic elements should normally remain 0."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:195
#: 7458055d75cd40c1b299b0244ff5b0d0
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:197
#: df24a97e8dc545e59ac22abd85872901
msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是标量磁矩但下游需要非共线向量时打开；如果原始数据已有方向信息，不要重新提升覆盖它。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `True`. Enable when scalar moments must be promoted to "
"noncollinear vectors. Do not promote again when the input already "
"contains directional information."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:199
#: 8b17f370ac154cf7a2c89e789156a08a
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:201
#: 105874e8b95543a78ad70ded1cbd45c0
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)`。这是方向参考，不是普通数值——改它会改变分层、表面法向或磁矩方向。使用前先确认 cell 取向和目标物理方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"This is a directional reference, not an ordinary scalar setting: changing"
" it changes a layering direction, surface normal, or moment direction. "
"Confirm the cell orientation and intended physical direction first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:203
#: f49612beb6a342088ed38865886fa438
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:205
#: da7d9acbfb6f4dbeafe314bd09e99b43
msgid "参考方向（reference_direction）"
msgstr "reference_direction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:207
#: 26458760e3554831b6564022c18ca2dd
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)`。canting "
"平面的首选侧向参考方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)`. "
"Preferred transverse reference direction used to define the canting "
"plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:209
#: 8d32a7d5140c4d9c8a7b6f422d8ea79f
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:211
#: 8bfc08ba76f44693a4aa289a07123c24
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。限制哪些元素参与目标筛选，留空则全部参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Restricts target selection to specified elements. "
"Leave empty to include all."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:213
#: 3b29eafd33084d52ac8ef75457138cd4
msgid "输出预算"
msgstr "Output Budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:215
#: 71e26ee88c2043998867906bb0190f03
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:217
#: ec9556ba4ea948e5ab01f80c84947f32
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `100`。自动 pair、角度列表和正负手性会相乘放大输出数量。这个上限包含 reference；开启 "
"`包含参考构型`（`include_reference`）时至少设为 2。先用 20-100 检查 pair 选择是否合理，确认后再扩大到完整 "
"DMI 扫描。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`. Automatic pairs, the angle list, and both "
"chiralities multiply the output count. The limit includes the reference; "
"when `include_reference` is enabled, set it to at least 2. Start with "
"20–100 outputs to verify pair selection, then expand to the full DMI "
"scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:219
#: 090a58fa5d514b64b4ba5654a991aefc
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:221
#: 31e2c3a9783440438189a874e631c27d
msgid "单自旋验证（~5 个输出，先确认流程正确）"
msgstr "Single-spin check (~5 outputs; validate the convention first)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:222
#: 4b277fdbf4db4e12bc3275cee9d62b08
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SmallAngleSpinTiltCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"canting_mode\": \"Single-spin tilt\",\n"
"  \"target_mode\": \"First eligible atom\",\n"
"  \"target_indices\": \"\",\n"
"  \"pair_left_indices\": \"\",\n"
"  \"pair_right_indices\": \"\",\n"
"  \"pair_source\": \"Manual indices\",\n"
"  \"pair_shell\": [1],\n"
"  \"pair_shell_tolerance\": [0.05],\n"
"  \"pair_element_filter\": \"\",\n"
"  \"pair_group_filter\": \"\",\n"
"  \"bond_filter_mode\": \"Any\",\n"
"  \"bond_filter_axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"  \"bond_filter_tolerance\": [20.0],\n"
"  \"group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"  \"group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"  \"angle_list\": \"1,2,5,10\",\n"
"  \"tilt_signs\": \"Positive only\",\n"
"  \"include_reference\": true,\n"
"  \"magnitude_source\": \"Existing initial magmoms\",\n"
"  \"magmom_map\": \"\",\n"
"  \"default_moment\": [0.0],\n"
"  \"lift_scalar\": true,\n"
"  \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"  \"reference_direction\": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0],\n"
"  \"apply_elements\": \"\",\n"
"  \"max_outputs\": [16]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:255
#: 4bdb3ce2ff1a4299a2f9a8075e01c26a
msgid "近邻对 DMI 训练集（~100 个输出，常规用途）"
msgstr "Neighbor-pair DMI set (~100 outputs; routine use)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:256
#: 5b87fff3f4ff4b95abe59d837b25de96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SmallAngleSpinTiltCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"canting_mode\": \"Atom pair canting\",\n"
"  \"target_mode\": \"First eligible atom\",\n"
"  \"target_indices\": \"\",\n"
