#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:329
#: 0e6d1352754841999d32b7e4c280455d
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:331
#: f8091b8343fd43bdbbc74ce500bd6d69
msgid ""
"**提示没有可倾斜磁矩或目标原子。** `Existing initial magmoms` 要求输入已有非零磁矩；否则切换到 "
"`Map/default magnitude` 并填写真实幅值。再检查 "
"`应用元素`（`apply_elements`）、手动索引和目标模式是否把所有原子过滤掉了。卡片不会再用原结构代替 canting 输出。"
msgstr ""
"**No tiltable moments or target atoms were found.** `Existing initial "
"magmoms` requires nonzero moments in the input; otherwise switch to "
"`Map/default magnitude` and enter physical magnitudes. Also check whether"
" `apply_elements`, manual indices, or the target mode filtered out every "
"atom. The card does not substitute the unchanged input for a canting "
"output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:333
#: 9f8b15cf7ffd47b28a8c5d408a32f9b1
msgid ""
"**提示没有有效 pair。** 手动模式检查左右索引数量和磁矩是否非零；自动模式调整 "
"`近邻壳层容差`（`pair_shell_tolerance`）——太大把不同壳层并到一起，太小把同一壳层拆开。再检查 "
"`原子对元素筛选`（`pair_element_filter`）、`原子对分组筛选`（`pair_group_filter`）和键方向筛选是否过紧。"
msgstr ""
"**No valid pair was found.** In manual mode, check the two index lists "
"and confirm both moments are nonzero. In automatic mode, adjust "
"`pair_shell_tolerance`: a value that is too large merges distinct shells,"
" while one that is too small splits a single shell. Also check whether "
"`pair_element_filter`, `pair_group_filter`, or the bond-direction filter "
"is too restrictive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:335
#: 17d5ea4f9770470c8ac9d7f8740d30c9
#
msgid ""
"**group pair canting 报错。** 输入需要 `arrays['group']`，而且 `A 组`（`group_a`）和 `B"
" 组`（`group_b`）中都要有至少一个非零磁矩原子。可以用 `原子层分组` 先生成逐层交替分组。"
msgstr ""
"**Group-pair canting reports an error.** The input must contain "
"`arrays['group']`, and both `Group A` (`group_a`) and `Group B` "
"(`group_b`) must contain at least one atom with a nonzero moment. Use "
"`Layer Groups` first to create alternating layer groups."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:337
#: 1146bb07253f432b88f00138cf378b5e
msgid ""
"**输出数量多于预期。** `Target Mode = All eligible atoms` + `Both (+/- pair)` "
"会快速膨胀。设 `最大输出数`（`max_outputs`）上限或改用 `First eligible atom`。"
msgstr ""
"**The output count is larger than expected.** `Target Mode = All eligible"
" atoms` combined with `Both (+/- pair)` grows quickly. Set a "
"`max_outputs` limit or use `First eligible atom`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:339
