#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:348
#: 3806ea1d30be4a2c8ed8829b6be7c1dd
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:350
#: 145e363a00e749a78135da3937e01c11
msgid "无随机性。相同输入、相同参数 → 严格一致输出。`参考方向`（`reference_direction`）会先对基准磁矩方向正交化，结果是确定性的。"
msgstr ""
"There is no randomness. Identical input and parameters produce identical "
"output. `reference_direction` is first orthogonalized against the "
"baseline moment direction, so the result is deterministic."

